{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object found within reach, grasp it, check and sort properties, carry to destination, else search or idle.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = GraspObject    /> <Action ID = CheckAndSortObject    /> <Action ID = CarryObjectToDestination    /> <Action ID = SearchForObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextDestination    /> <Action ID = Idle    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    />\"",
